{"body":"This PR extracts the core prefix-caching fixes from #59826, excluding the Mooncake-specific changes.\r\n\r\n- Fix the Mamba prompt checkpoint boundary to avoid applying both the `P - 1` cap and EAGLE’s block drop.\r\n- Allow attention lookup to inspect the cached EAGLE proof beyond the final hit limit.\r\n- Keep Mamba checkpoint calculation and registration consistent across the scheduler and workers.\r\n","files":[{"path":"tests/models/kimi_k3/test_amd_kda_checkpoint.py","additions":6,"deletions":1},{"path":"tests/models/kimi_k3/test_kda_metadata.py","additions":52,"deletions":8},{"path":"tests/models/kimi_k3/test_prefix_cache.py","additions":40,"deletions":0},{"path":"tests/v1/attention/test_gdn_metadata_builder.py","additions":6,"deletions":2},{"path":"tests/v1/attention/test_mamba2_prefill_checkpoints.py","additions":7,"deletions":2},{"path":"tests/v1/core/prefix_cache/test_partial_prefix_cache_hits.py","additions":201,"deletions":52},{"path":"tests/v1/core/test_prefix_caching.py","additions":11,"deletions":27},{"path":"vllm/config/cache.py","additions":11,"deletions":0},{"path":"vllm/model_executor/layers/mamba/checkpoint.py","additions":9,"deletions":2},{"path":"vllm/v1/core/block_pool.py","additions":2,"deletions":5},{"path":"vllm/v1/core/kv_cache_coordinator.py","additions":29,"deletions":40},{"path":"vllm/v1/core/kv_cache_utils.py","additions":93,"deletions":15},{"path":"vllm/v1/core/sched/scheduler.py","additions":17,"deletions":18},{"path":"vllm/v1/core/single_type_kv_cache_manager.py","additions":34,"deletions":26},{"path":"vllm/v1/engine/core.py","additions":14,"deletions":0},{"path":"vllm/v1/kv_cache_interface.py","additions":8,"deletions":1},{"path":"vllm/v1/worker/gpu_worker.py","additions":7,"deletions":2}],"mergeCommit":{"oid":"d8fa463e2ba751759a3534dd3ce11af92f1eed83"},"number":60533,"title":"[Bugfix][Prefix caching] Fix inconsistent hybrid Mamba prefix cache boundaries"}
